  "notes": [
    "The university was originally founded as 'Egypt International Technological University' and was officially renamed 'Helwan International Technological University' by Prime Ministerial Decree No. 3988 of 2024.",
    "The program spans 7 years starting after middle school, combining the equivalent of secondary and university education.",
    "The curriculum is primarily applied and practical, with extensive field training in factories and companies.",
    "The roadmap provided here is based on available information and standard curricula for these specializations — specific course details may vary.",
    "It is recommended to contact the university directly for the most up-to-date official study plan."
  ]
